'''Essence of Anger''' can be used to upgrade an equipment with a guaranteed [[affix]] related to:
* Local +#Fire damage
* Fire Damage
* Fire Resistance

Monsters that are possessed by these essences will periodically cast a fire version of {{il|Creeping Frost}}. They will also apply a timed [[debuff]] named '''Essence of Anger''' to the player character, which reduces their fire resistance.

'''Essence of Anger''' refer to the following [[essence]]s (see the table). 

